Package: iQualityR.reliability
Title: Reliability and Survival Analysis for iQualityR
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Provides reliability and survival analysis tools, including
  parametric lifetime distribution fitting (Weibull, exponential,
  lognormal, logistic), Kaplan-Meier nonparametric survival estimation,
  Cox proportional hazards regression, reliability metrics (MTTF, B10,
  B50 life), and related visualizations and reporting, consistent with
  the iQualityR ecosystem.
